C++ Garbage Collection  
1. What is Garbage Collection?

Garbage Collection (GC) is an automatic memory-management technique in which a runtime system identifies memory that is no longer being used by a program and automatically reclaims that memory.
Standard C++ does not have a built-in automatic garbage collector like Java or C#. C++ mainly provides deterministic resource management through mechanisms such as destructors, delete, and RAII.

Note->C++ is not a garbage-collected language by default.
C++ gives programmers greater direct control over memory management.

Garbage Collection एक automatic memory-management technique है, जिसमें system/program runtime ऐसी memory को identify करता है जो अब program के लिए उपयोगी नहीं है और उस memory को automatically वापस free कर देता है।
Standard C++ में Java या C# की तरह built-in automatic Garbage Collector नहीं होता। C++ में memory और resources को manage करने के लिए delete, destructors और विशेष रूप से RAII का उपयोग किया जाता है।C++ programmer को memory management पर ज्यादा direct control देता है।

Object/Memory Created
        ↓
Program Uses It
        ↓
Object No Longer Needed
        ↓
Garbage Collector Identifies It
        ↓
Memory Reclaimed

2. What is Garbage?

Garbage is memory or an object that is no longer reachable or useful to the program but still occupies memory.

Garbage ऐसी memory/object को कहा जाता है जो program के लिए अब useful नहीं है, लेकिन memory में space occupy कर रहा है।

Example Concept
Memory
┌───────────────┐
│ Object A      │ ← In use
├───────────────┤
│ Object B      │ ← No longer needed // Garbage  
├───────────────┤
│ Object C      │ ← In use
└───────────────┘

Example

Student *s = new Student;

// Use object

delete s; // Programmer Explicity object  dynamically allocated memory release 

In C++, the programmer can decide when to release a dynamically allocated resource. This provides precise control over resource management.

C++ में programmer खुद decide कर सकता है कि dynamically allocated resource को कब release करना है। इससे resource management पर precise control मिलता है। 


