12. RAII —Important C++ Concept-->

RAII (Resource Acquisition Is Initialization) is a C++ resource-management technique in which a resource is acquired and associated with an object'/'s lifetime, and the resource is automatically released when the object is destroyed.

RAII (Resource Acquisition Is Initialization) C++ की एक important resource-management technique है, जिसमें resource को object के lifetime से associate किया जाता है और object destroy होने पर resource automatically release हो जाता है।

Simple Idea

Object Created
     ↓
Resource Acquired
     ↓
Object Used
     ↓
Object Destroyed
     ↓
Resource Automatically Released

RAII C++ में garbage collection की जरूरत को कई situations में कम करता है।

